  <!-- EN: mutation - Colossus -->
  <EGO_Mutation_Armor.label>突变 - 巨像</EGO_Mutation_Armor.label>
  <!-- EN: Mutation is an amalgam-technological adaptation that alters the Symbiote, strengthening its bond with the host and granting enhanced abilities. Its purpose is to achieve higher performance and improve resistance to damage across the whole body.\n\nImplantation requires - symbiont.\n\nThis mutation can be implanted up to 15 times to increase its effect. -->
  <EGO_Mutation_Armor.description>突变是一种融合科技适应性改造，能够改变共生体，增强其与宿主的结合并赋予增强能力。其目的是实现更高的性能并提高全身对伤害的抵抗力。\n\n植入需要 - 共生体。\n\n这种突变最多可植入15次以增强效果。</EGO_Mutation_Armor.description>
